  unitName: Snow Sibyl Eliza
  unitId: 20244
  unitNumber: 394
  description: The second oldest of the Six Sibyl Sisters. When the great war with
    the gods first broke out she fought alongside her sisters in defense of the humans,
    but after witnessing endless atrocities committed by humans she decided she'd
    made a mistake. From that point forward she began wielding her blade against
    humans, becoming one of the feared Fresh Blood Sisters. It's said the origin
    of her hatred for her sister Freya came from the fact she overlooked the crimes
    of humans in favor of forgiving them.
  summonDesc: You dare judge the gods?<br>Fine, then I shall decide whether<br>or
    not you decision is just.
  fusionDesc: My blade, stained red with blood.<br>Even so, you still wish to use
    it?<br>Humans are such dreadful beings.
  evoDesc: My sister used to tell me that<br>not all humans are sinners.<br>Can you
    prove her right?<br>
  element: 2
  rarity: 4
